@Pokedex.Server_HostAddress = http://localhost:5219

### All Pokemon (for the dropdowns)
GET {{Pokedex.Server_HostAddress}}/api/pokemon
Accept: application/json

### Pikachu
GET {{Pokedex.Server_HostAddress}}/api/pokemon/25
Accept: application/json

### Random Pokemon
GET {{Pokedex.Server_HostAddress}}/api/pokemon/random
Accept: application/json

### Invalid number (should return 400 Bad Request)
GET {{Pokedex.Server_HostAddress}}/api/pokemon/152
Accept: application/json
